## Frisco’s Finest: Carrier Infinity 26 Air Conditioner (24VNA6) 

The Infinity 26 is Carrier’s most advanced model, delivering exceptional energy efficiency and comfort. It’s built to handle extreme temperatures and provides a near-silent cooling experience. We call this model the “Is it on?” system because when we installed our first 24VNA6, we had to walk within two feet of the outdoor unit just to confirm the fan was spinning—it was that quiet! If you love entertaining and your AC sits near your outdoor kitchen or patio, you’ll appreciate the near silent operation when this unit kicks on.

