# Single-zone Universal Hyper-heating Heat Pump

## PUZ-HA

P-Series Light Commercial Outdoor model

Our unique Flash Injection circuit achieves remarkably high heating performance in the PUZ-HA outdoor Hyper-heating heat pump. This technology has resulted in excellent heating capacity ratings in outdoor temperatures as low as 5° F. The guaranteed heating operation range of the heating mode extends to -13° F. The Flash Injection circuit improves start-up and recovery from the defrosting operation. The defrost operation control improves the required defrost frequency. These features enable the temperature to reach the set point fast and contribute to maintaining the desired setting.

